      "content": "that makes sense. one more thing—when discussing the \"execution risks\" or potential \"hidden costs\" in the memo, do you think it's appropriate to mention how unexpected market volatility or technical glitches might affect these prices? i want to make sure i'm covering any possible \"unseen\" factors that could disrupt the expected value for the client.",
